          "_name": "header17",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"header16\" group=\"Headers\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"24\" step=\"1\" value=\"20\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Content Width\" name=\"contentWidth\" min=\"3\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"12\">\n    <header>Show / Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n    <select title=\"Vertical Align\" name=\"verticalAlign\" condition=\"fullScreen\">\n      <option value=\"flex-start\">Top</option>\n      <option value=\"center\" selected>Center</option>\n      <option value=\"flex-end\">Bottom</option>\n    </select>\n    <select title=\"Horizontal Align\" name=\"horizontalAlign\">\n      <option value=\"flex-start\">Left</option>\n      <option value=\"center\" selected>Center</option>\n      <option value=\"flex-end\">Right</option>\n    </select>\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/img-4176-1464x1098.jpeg\" parallax selected>\n      <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2Gg6Seob5Mg\">\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#260a30\">\n    </fieldset>\n    <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type!='color'\" checked>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#0f1b32\" condition=\"bg.type!='color' && overlay\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Overlay Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"bg.type!='color' && overlay\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"content-wrap col-12 col-md-{{contentWidth}}\">\n        <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mbr-white mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>RULES &amp; EXPECTATIONS</b></h1>\n        <h2 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mbr-white mb-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\">What we expect from all members.</h2>\n        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text mbr-white mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Learn more about our flagship initiative, Project Skylab.</p>\n        <div class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" href=\"#list02-t\">Learn More</a></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "uVApDFZnxK",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {},
          "_anchor": "header17-v"
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".counter-container": {
              "ol": {
                "margin-bottom": "0",
                "padding-left": "2.25rem",
                "li": {
                  "margin-bottom": "2rem",
                  "list-style": "none",
                  "position": "relative",
                  "&:before": {
                    "font-weight": "700",
                    "position": "absolute",
                    "left": "-1.5em",
                    "counter-increment": "myCounter",
                    "content": "counter(myCounter)",
                    "transition": "all .2s",
                    "color": "@iconColor",
                    "display": "flex",
                    "align-items": "center",
                    "justify-content": "center"
                  }
                },
                "counter-reset": "myCounter"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "text-align": "center"
            }
          },
          "_name": "article17",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article17\" group=\"Article\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"9\" step=\"1\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#9fe870\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"row mb-5 justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n          <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n              <b>CODE OF CONDUCT</b></h3>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\"><i>As members of StuyAviators at Stuyvesant High School, all participants are expected to uphold the highest standards of conduct to maintain a safe, respectful, and inclusive environment. Membership implies agreement to the following expectations:</i></h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n          <ol>\n            <li><b style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">Respect for All.&nbsp;</b><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">Members shall treat peers, club leadership, faculty advisors, and guests with courtesy, professionalism, and consideration at all times. Interactions should be constructive, and conflicts should be resolved respectfully.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">Prohibition of Malicious Humor. </b><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">Members must refrain from making jokes, comments, or references to historical events in a malicious or harmful manner, and must not engage in any illegal, unsafe, or inappropriate actions, such as intentionally damaging equipment or misusing simulators.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">Commitment to Inclusivity.&nbsp;</b><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">All members should strive to create a welcoming environment, encouraging participation from students of all grades, backgrounds, and experience levels. Discriminatory or exclusionary behavior is unacceptable.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">Responsible Use of Resources.&nbsp;</b><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">All club equipment, including flight simulators, computers, and other materials, must be used responsibly and with care. Members are expected to follow safety protocols and handle shared resources properly.</span></li><li><b>Collaboration and Cooperation.</b>&nbsp;Members should actively support their peers, contribute positively to projects and group activities, and help foster a collaborative, team-oriented club environment.</li><li><b>Respectful Communication. </b>All communication, whether verbal, written, or online (including emails, Discord, and other platforms), should remain respectful, professional, and appropriate at all times.</li><li><b>Adherence to Leadership and Advisor Guidance. </b>Members are expected to follow the guidance of the Flight Crew and faculty advisors, understanding that their leadership is essential for the club’s smooth and effective operation.</li><li><b>Privacy and Consent. </b>By participating in StuyAviators activities, members grant the club leadership permission to take photos and videos for documentation, promotion, or official purposes. However, members are not permitted to record, photograph, or share other members’ work or personal information without explicit consent.</li><li><b style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">Dedication to Learning.</b><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">&nbsp;Members are encouraged to approach all aviation activities, workshops, and discussions with curiosity, diligence, and a commitment to personal growth, skill development, and exploration of aviation.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\"><b>Compliance with Institutional Policies.</b> All members agree to abide by the rules, regulations, and guidelines established by the <a href=\"https://epsilon.stuysu.org/rules\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">Stuyvesant Student Union</a>, <a href=\"https://stuy.enschool.org/apps/pages/index.jsp?uREC_ID=126635&type=d\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">Stuyvesant High School</a>, and the <a href=\"https://www.schools.nyc.gov/docs/default-source/default-document-library/a-601-english.pdf\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">New York City Department of Education</a>. These standards take precedence over club policies and must be respected at all times.</span></li>\n          </ol>\n          <ol>\n          </ol>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "uVAqDchGeC",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {},
          "_anchor": "article17-x"
        },
        {
